      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'In order to test the dolls temperature, you need the thermometer. It looks
    like a little gun and has green lights out of it.



    By using the thermometer,
    you check the temperature of what is in front of you (or more so in your vicinity).
    Cursed dolls may have abnormal temperatures.



    The buildings temperature
    is around 16 - 25 Celsius. So if the thermometer shows simular values, the doll
    has passed the temperature test.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
