  m_text: 'To begin audio testing, you need to go to the ''Tests'' Section on the
    computer, and from there you can start the audio. It''s the melody of twinkle
    twinkle little star, with the sounds of children at play in the background.



    In
    order to begin an audio test, the doll MUST be placed on the chair in the testing
    chamber room, in front of the glass.'
