  m_text: 'To execute the name calling test, the doll needs to be sitting on the
    chair in the testing chamber room in front of the glass. After it is, get in
    front of the doll behind the glass, and Interact with the glass while facing
    the glass.



    You will call out the name, that was given to them by their
    owner.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
